  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 4 sp; <strong>Quality</strong> common; <strong>Weight</strong> 1/2 lbs.<br>\nIn the highlands, these pies are common in two varieties: The forfar birdie, a pastry that is filled with finely ground beef and onions; and the scotch pie, which is filled with minced beef, bread crumbs, and gravy. Individually, each pie is large enough to be a meal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/adventuring-gear#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
